specctx baseline prune: Remove the entries that no longer apply.

Usage:
  `specctx baseline prune [flags]`

Flags:
  `--root <path>`              Use this project root.
  `--json`                     Print one JSON document.
  `--help`                     Show this help.

Exit codes:
