== help
specctx help: Show the help page of one command.

Usage:
  `specctx help <command> [flags]`

Flags:
  `--root <path>`              Use this project root.
  `--json`                     Print one JSON document.
  `--help`                     Show this help.

Exit codes:
  `0` Success.
  `2` An unknown command.

Example:
  `specctx help task start`
